________________________________________________________________________________


[00] Repositories
________________________________________________________________________________

* scripts ---------- node scripts (e.g. build-content.js: markdown -> generated/posts.json)
* src/Components --- interactive islands (Luna PureApp) for hydrate & client rendering
* src/App.purs ----- app shell, layout, routing wiring
* src/Pages -------- page views (Home, About, Article, Collection, Project)
* src/Prerender ---- static HTML output helpers used by PrerenderMain
* content ---------- markdown sources (articles/, til/, projects/)
* generated -------- posts.json emitted by the content script (consumed by PureScript)
* public ----------- static assets copied into dist/ on build
* css -------------- Tailwind entry (style.css) compiled to dist/css/

[01] Architectures
________________________________________________________________________________

[Core] -------------------------------------------------------------------------

Purescript   Luna*           Node                          TailwindCSS
Spago        purs-backend-es Markdown-it                   esbuild
Argonaut     routing         js-yaml                       @tailwindcss/typography

[02] Details modified pkgs (*)
________________________________________________________________________________

1. Luna [ https://github.com/fahmiirsyadk/luna.git ]
Pinned in spago.yaml (extraPackages). Static render + document shell in PrerenderMain;
client hydration entry is Main.

2. purs-backend-es [ bundled via pnpm ]
Production bundle uses bundle-app with --minify; spago bundle in spago.yaml targets
dist/app.js for dev-style output (see package.json scripts).

[03] Run
________________________________________________________________________________

1. Install via pnpm install & spago install (package name: site — see spago.yaml)
2. Full site build: pnpm run build  (runs build.sh: content -> spago build -> PrerenderMain
   -> purs-backend-es bundle -> Tailwind -> copy public assets to dist/)
3. One-off compile: pnpm run spago:build ; prerender only: pnpm run prerender
4. Preview static output: pnpm run serve  (serve dist on port 8080 by default)
